  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, ginger, and garlic, and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add coconut milk, chicken broth, curry powder, cumin powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10-15 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in coriander leaves (if using).",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
